&P262162 = PBS 08/2, 110 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. 1/2(disz) sar 3(disz) gin2 e2 du3-a
#tr.en: One built house plot of 33 shekels,
2. da e2 e-sir2 {d}nin-kar-ra
#tr.en: adjacent to the house in the street of Ninkarrak
3. u3 u-bar-{d}utu szesz-a-ni
#tr.en: of Ubar-šamaš his brother,
4. sag-bi e2 {d}a-ba
#tr.en: its front is (adjacent to) the temple of Aba,
5. e2 i-din-{d}utu dumu {d}en-lil2-ra-bi#
#tr.en: is the house of I(d)din-šamaš, son of Enlil-rabi,
6. ki i-din-{d}utu-ta 
#tr.en: (that) from I(d)din-šamaš
