8. u3 s,i-li2-{d}utu szesz-a-ni-ke4
#tr.en: and Ṣilli-šamaš his brother
9. in-szi-in-sa10
#tr.en: have bought;
10. sa10-am3 til-la-bi-sze3
#tr.en: its full price,
11. 1(u) 1(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar
#tr.en: 11 shekels of silver,
12. in-na-an-la2-esz
#tr.en: they have paid.
@reverse 
1. u4 kur2-sze3 i-din-{d}utu
